- Sinkhorn-Knopp algorithm: entropy regularization parameter λ = 0.1
- Cross-attention: 8 heads, 64-dimensional per head
- Doubly stochastic constraint enforced every forward pass
- Gradient clipping at lane boundaries: max norm 1.0

